<title>USA: NYSE closing averages. [CORRECTED 22:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages. [CORRECTED 22:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended sharply higher in heavy trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 143.29 (corrects from 142.48) points to 7,214.49 (corrects from 7213.68), a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 8.46 to 431.43, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.85.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1963 to 674.</p>
<p>Volume was 549,400,210 compared with 499,730,640 on Friday.</p>
